== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*Contrary to the description, this spell affects friends as well as foes.
*Though a stunned character must remain in the cloud, they are not required to make an additional save each round if they have already failed a save. If the cloud does not affect them and they remain in it, however, they will be required to make a save the following round.
*Targets that are immune to [[mind-affecting]] spells can still be blinded by the cloud, though they will not be stunned.
* Though not reported in the combat log, immunity to [[poison]] grants full immunity to all effects.

